 1820 to 1910. It is the home of the world\u2019s largest collection of working Cornish engines, including the Grand Junction 90 inch, the largest such engine in the world. The site is an anchor point on the European Route of Industrial Heritage (ERIH).", "short_description": "A companion app for the London Museum of Water & Steam. This experience shows the steam machines installed at the museum and demonstrates their functioning."}]}, "developer_name": "ThinQ Digital Media Limited", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.thinqdigitalmedia.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.thinqdigitalmedia.com/terms", "publisher_name": "ThinQ Digital Media Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.thinqdigitalmedia.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "629497504975600"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386220_613220832356359_3082686319705456640_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3IRFzcdTxEMQ7kNvwEpMCzH&_nc_oc=AdldtWDeCQy5XAJ9mpTNRCICNOziNCzU_rbrup2vC-r7b4fhJKW9DzWdyGal2fZ8KLU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzP8rEHSJOVO8G-cYYjXQl2TWM3wzzq-xYHTq0SN8Y9vw&oe=69B412FF"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Steam Museum", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "rel